Kalamar engine
==============

The Kalamar engine is a fork of totk-pc-recomp by Valiantsin Dzerakh (valentderah),
https://github.com/valentderah/totk-pc-recomp, imported at upstream commit
ae30a61b7bee4a3db959a234e7459e95939ac596 (VERSION 0.3.13). totk-pc-recomp is
distributed under the MIT License; LICENSE is kept unchanged and applies to the
imported code and to the changes made in this fork.

The upstream's changes from that commit to its release 0.4.0
(7a37fc3c346cd6f2b3c80637effb27b880ce817b) were taken in later, one upstream
commit at a time. Their contributors are named in the upstream's history; the
history published with Kalamar starts fresh and does not reproduce it.

totk-pc-recomp itself builds on other permissively licensed projects (LAS Recomp,
MacNativeGames, Ryujinx and others). Their notices are listed in
THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md and continue to apply.

The fork adapts the toolchain to Splatoon 3 (program 0100C2500FC20000) version
11.2.0. It contains no game code, game data or keys: the game, its keys and
everything extracted, lifted or built from them stay outside the repository.
